Comment: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:08.00,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Opening Talk ===
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:08.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Good evening! I'm Noguchi Ruriko,\Nthe voice of Leo/need's Ichika Hoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:10.92,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Good evening! I'm Nakashima Yuki,\Nthe voice of Leo/need's Shiho Hinomori.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:18.14,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes! Welcome to SekaRaji, the radio show brought to you by the cast of the mobile game Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:18.89,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Hatsune Miku!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:22.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Today, Yuki-chan and I will be hosting together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:24.68,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:29.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Starting with this episode,\NSekaRaji is back to pairing up members from the same unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:27.86,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:31.13,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.21,0:00:35.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's been quite a while since Yuki-chan and I teamed up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:35.22,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's been ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:36.23,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Feels like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:38.44,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Actually, it might've been a while\Nsince I was on SekaRaji at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.44,0:00:41.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really? I feel like I did it a few times with Karin-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:42.42,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:45.96,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,yeah, though it still feels like it's been a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:46.51,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.43,0:00:46.94,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.51,0:00:47.50,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:49.20,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Glad to be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:51.53,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Likewise! Well, by the time this airs, the Thanks Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.53,0:00:52.50,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.57,0:00:53.07,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,will have wrapped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.69,0:00:55.19,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Great work!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:58.69,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Great work to you, too! We got to perform on both days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.94,0:00:58.44,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.77,0:01:00.27,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,We sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:02.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,The energy was amazing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:02.35,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:04.49,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,The crowd was so hyped, it made me really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.51,0:01:04.54,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.49,0:01:09.47,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It was so good. Actually, my mom came to the venue,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:06.23,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:09.56,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:18.13,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,and she told me how moved she was when the concert part ended,\Nbecause everyone in the crowd shouted "Thank you!" to each unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.69,0:01:11.27,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:12.38,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:16.39,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.73,0:01:18.23,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.21,0:01:20.02,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I had no idea! Hearing about that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.23,0:01:19.56,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,That makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:22.56,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:22.77,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,really let me feel the excitement all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:26.86,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It was so fun. Plus, the venue was bigger than ever before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.68,0:01:25.18,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.86,0:01:29.97,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.16,0:01:33.47,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right?! And they set up a center stage, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:33.97,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They did!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:36.45,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah! Last time it had wings, like a U-shaped walkway, right?\NBut this time we had a center stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.45,0:01:38.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.35,0:01:39.85,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:43.61,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,With a runway leading out to it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:43.10,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.61,0:01:46.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We got to move around so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:49.28,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Moving around like\Nthat gave us a chance to get really close to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.53,0:01:49.03,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.76,0:01:52.79,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You know what was funny, though? On the way to the center stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.20,0:01:51.70,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.79,0:01:56.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,underneath the stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:56.81,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, right, underground!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:58.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,wasn't moving through there hilarious?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.52,0:01:59.02,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It was so funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.48,0:02:02.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,The staff pushed us all the way there completely by hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.52,0:02:03.44,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,While we rode on that cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.52,0:02:04.81,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right! And it doesn't go smoothly at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:04.49,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It goes like, clunk-clunk-clunk-clunk-bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.81,0:02:08.94,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, getting it onto the rails is actually pretty tough,\Napparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.94,0:02:11.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Just rattling like clunk-clunk-bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.15,0:02:16.32,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I felt so bad sitting there thinking, "I'm so sorry!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:19.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Three of us riding on it going,\N"Oh, sorry! Excuse us! Thank you so much!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.44,0:02:19.94,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,All we could do was cheer them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.58,0:02:22.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,While feeling super apologetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:22.62,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.77,0:02:24.19,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Even getting around backstage was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:25.65,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Getting around was fun, and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.19,0:02:24.96,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.65,0:02:29.28,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,going out to the center stage really makes you feel surrounded by everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.28,0:02:30.83,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:31.23,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.24,0:02:33.87,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Everyone's voices felt even closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:34.37,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah! And we could see everyone's happy faces right up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:35.75,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right? Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:38.99,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We rarely get to sing that close to the crowd, so it was a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:36.32,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.81,0:02:40.70,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Man, that was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.99,0:02:44.17,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:43.70,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, thank you all so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.17,0:02:44.67,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Seriously, thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.96,0:02:49.87,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Well, the script here says, "Autumn is well underway now."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:50.33,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:52.68,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,though, we actually have a proper autumn this year, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:53.18,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We really do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.33,0:02:53.83,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right? Like, every year,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.59,0:02:55.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.72,0:03:00.55,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,it doesn't finally start getting chilly until late September or October,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.69,0:03:01.87,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.51,0:03:02.01,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,you know? But this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.87,0:03:02.37,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:04.77,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,we actually got rain in August, and typhoons cooled things down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.77,0:03:13.31,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right. Autumn rolled right in\Nbefore it even felt much like summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:16.16,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Man, I'm glad. I love autumn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:16.71,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I get you. It's nice, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:17.34,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:21.33,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Getting to feel this seasonal vibe we haven't had in years
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.73,0:03:20.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.17,0:03:22.67,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,So true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.05,0:03:23.55,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,makes me really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:27.10,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That slightly crisp, dry air is so nice too, isn't it? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:27.12,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:30.55,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,With that little thrill of feeling winter on its way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.55,0:03:31.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:33.86,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I hope we have a great time this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.97,0:03:34.47,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Let's do our best this autumn, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:35.82,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Let's do our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:36.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:39.15,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,With that said, please enjoy this episode of SekaRaji!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:49.35,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,This program is brought to you by Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.35,0:03:50.27,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Hatsune Miku.
Comment: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:55.27,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Exchange Notebook ===
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:55.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Once again, I'm Noguchi Ruriko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.27,0:03:56.48,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,And I'm Nakashima Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:59.65,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We have another question waiting in the exchange notebook today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.54,0:04:00.04,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:03.86,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's a question from last episode's hosts,\NImai-san and Tanabe-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:04.36,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:10.15,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,"If you were to dress up, what kind of costume would you want the other to wear?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:10.66,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ooh, that's a fun question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:14.95,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And Imai-san wrote "like a witch" for Tanabe-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.01,0:04:15.51,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,"Like a witch."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:17.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's pretty broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:18.39,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Super broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:22.63,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And Tanabe-san wrote "Bandage Man" for Imai-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.63,0:04:23.13,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,What's a Bandage Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:25.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Like, bandages?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:27.63,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Wrapped up all over so you can only see their eyes or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:31.89,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, like that? So not even a mummy, just a Bandage Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.89,0:04:33.09,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Bandage Man. Never heard of that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.92,0:04:35.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Can't tell if they're actually injured or not, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:36.64,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,True, you can't tell. Wonder what they're hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:40.17,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Sounds fun, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:41.33,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I see. So for the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.17,0:04:42.09,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Costumes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.09,0:04:45.08,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:44.34,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,First off, do you ever dress up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:46.50,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:51.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,At the apartment building I lived\Nin as a kid, we had a kids' club
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.01,0:04:51.55,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.24,0:04:54.20,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,that put on little events,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:53.84,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:57.02,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,so I dressed up like a princess for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:04:57.57,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:05:00.87,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Ever since then, I haven't dressed up on my own at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.87,0:05:04.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You don't strike me as the type either, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:05.30,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:07.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:07.59,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Sometimes we do it for work and stuff, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:09.22,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:15.40,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,If a livestream happens to fall near Halloween,\Nwe might put on a little hat or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:09.95,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:13.30,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:16.49,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:18.01,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,We do light stuff like that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:17.14,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:20.66,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Picking what we want each other to wear is fun, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:20.70,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,What I'd want you to wear, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:24.13,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Since it's Halloween. A witch... What else is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:26.69,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,A zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:27.65,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,A zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.69,0:05:28.24,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,A jiangshi,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:28.95,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:29.52,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:29.61,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.52,0:05:30.46,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Like a nun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.61,0:05:30.39,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, true, true!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:31.93,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That totally counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:30.97,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Does that kind of thing count?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:32.97,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, it counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:34.82,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.41,0:05:38.08,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,For Ruri-chan, let's see, what would be good?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:39.58,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Ooh, tough choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.57,0:05:40.07,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, tough choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:45.11,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Mine might stray a little away from Halloween, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.11,0:05:45.74,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,For Yuki-chan, I'm thinking something punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.27,0:05:47.77,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:49.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Dark makeup around the eyes, hair flipped out,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.40,0:05:49.90,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:52.46,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:52.89,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,wearing stripes or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:54.05,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:53.70,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Like punk rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.05,0:05:54.55,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Whoa! I wanna try that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:56.31,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I've always thought it'd look amazing on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:58.11,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:06:00.58,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Like that certain music manga,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.17,0:06:02.68,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:04.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,"NANA", right? Like from "NANA".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:05.89,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Got it, got it, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:06.09,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Like the vocalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:06.68,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.09,0:06:10.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I think you'd rock that for sure,\Neven if it's not strictly Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:13.23,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Well, Halloween costumes nowadays basically turn into a big
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.23,0:06:14.15,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,cosplay fest anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.41,0:06:13.54,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It does turn into cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.15,0:06:17.50,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It does, so that popped into my head as something\NI really want you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:17.29,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Aw, I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:21.19,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I want you to spike your hair up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:23.12,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,True! I love that, sounds super fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:24.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I'd love to see you do it someday, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:26.13,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,As for Ruri-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.77,0:06:26.42,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.17,0:06:26.63,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,what should it be? Actually,\Nduring the talk segment at the recent Thanks Festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:32.42,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,that blue one-piece, that dress you wore,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:27.26,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:33.57,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, the dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.61,0:06:34.11,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,suited you way too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:36.59,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:36.63,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ever since I saw that, I thought, "Cinderella would be perfect!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.59,0:06:43.50,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I couldn't possibly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.51,0:06:43.63,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It really stuck with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:44.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:49.03,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,To make it a Halloween costume,\Nmaybe we should add a little fake blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:50.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:50.43,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Just a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.40,0:06:52.53,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Go as a blood-soaked princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.53,0:06:53.75,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.76,0:06:57.84,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It's a bit wild, so maybe just add a touch of red.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.84,0:06:58.34,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.25,0:06:59.75,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Would that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:00.71,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I think that could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.37,0:07:01.87,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.17,0:07:04.93,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Something like that, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.11,0:07:05.53,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:06.25,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.53,0:07:07.29,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Someday, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:06.75,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Someday, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.29,0:07:07.79,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Let's all do it together someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.37,0:07:09.87,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Wonder if that day will come?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.49,0:07:11.99,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Who knows, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.13,0:07:13.63,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That was a fun question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.32,0:07:16.56,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you! In the ending, we'll be leaving a message\Nin the exchange notebook for next episode's hosts, too.
Comment: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:24.72,Yuki Nakashima,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Listener Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:24.72,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,All right, let's read some listener mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:25.22,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:31.52,Yuki Nakashima,host_meta,0,0,0,,First up, this is from 100%豆腐ハンバーグ. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:32.03,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.44,0:07:36.64,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Noguchi-san, Nakashima-san, kon-needo." Kon-needo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:36.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-needo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:41.38,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I'm a newcomer who started playing ProSeka around when the movie came out."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:41.93,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:42.17,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:44.70,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"During the 4.5th Anniversary event, I was deeply moved by Leo/need's music,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.41,0:07:52.69,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"and by my absolute favorite character, Shiho-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.69,0:07:53.19,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.69,0:07:57.24,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It got me interested in music, and made me really want to try playing bass."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.73,0:07:58.77,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh my, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:59.03,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Whoa, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.03,0:08:01.40,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"So I have a question."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:01.86,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:04.30,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Out of all the songs in ProSeka,"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.86,0:08:02.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:07.97,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"are there any you recommend for bass practice, or just for singing?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:09.42,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:10.98,Yuki Nakashima,host_meta,0,0,0,,"I'd love to hear your thoughts." That's what they wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.18,0:08:12.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, the bass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.17,0:08:14.67,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Bass, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:18.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I feel like the bass really stands out in Shiho's songs,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:19.21,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, she has a lot of cool songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:19.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,that's my impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.00,0:08:22.85,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, they're all super hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.85,0:08:23.71,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.16,0:08:27.13,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.04,0:08:27.61,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.86,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Still, picking up bass is awesome. It really is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:30.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:31.54,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Seriously, it's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:34.18,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.32,0:08:37.06,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You know, since ProSeka's songs are Vocaloid tracks,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.06,0:08:37.56,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:39.32,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:40.90,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,every single one of them is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:40.81,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.90,0:08:43.38,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Incredibly difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:47.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,At the recent Thanks Festival,\NI was honestly fighting for my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.40,0:08:44.51,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Incredibly difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.69,0:08:48.19,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Tell me about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:53.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I stood on\Nthat stage literally praying I'd make it through the songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.16,0:08:54.88,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:55.85,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:58.57,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Every time they check with us on the setlist,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:08:59.00,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.00,0:09:03.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,asking,\N"We're thinking of going with these songs, how does that sound?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:03.77,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:05.20,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We're like, "Wait, what?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:05.97,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We end up pushing back on it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:09.90,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Like, "Um, doing this one live might be a little dicey."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:12.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We get to sing songs where\Nthat kind of thing happens pretty often.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:14.05,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.36,0:09:18.68,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Makes us wish we were Virtual Singers too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:19.75,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,If only we could become Virtual Singers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.75,0:09:25.83,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,So yeah, there are a lot of tough songs to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:27.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,There really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:27.60,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:30.10,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They asked for songs we recommend singing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:31.18,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Well, anniversary songs are great for getting hyped and singing together, like "Pentatonic".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.18,0:09:32.79,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:39.11,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.91,0:09:41.17,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Those are relatively... well, I wouldn't call them easy to sing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.11,0:09:39.83,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.17,0:09:42.24,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:44.66,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,definitely not easy, but they're catchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:45.79,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.63,0:09:47.30,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,So they might actually be a good pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:46.99,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:49.02,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,"NEO" is like that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.03,0:09:49.77,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,And "Journey" too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:53.84,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, yes! Those get everyone hyped!\NAnniversary songs would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:57.27,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,For Leo/need, "needLe" might be pretty approachable to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:57.41,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:09:59.78,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,We got to sing it live for the first time at Thanks Festival,\Nand it's a real crowd-pleaser.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.41,0:10:02.31,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It gets the crowd going,\Nand it really hit me again what a great song it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:06.28,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Same here. It really reminded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:06.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:08.25,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Like, "Man, 'needLe' is such a good song."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.48,0:10:12.58,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Such a good song. Plus it was our first time singing it live.\NDefinitely recommend that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:15.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,So definitely try "needLe", along with practicing it on bass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:19.32,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,For bass practice... wait, how is "needLe" on bass?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.32,0:10:19.82,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,What do you think, as a bassist?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.48,0:10:23.09,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Uhh, I have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:26.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You don't know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:30.00,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Um, I have played "HIBANA" before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:32.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:35.73,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,The BPM on "HIBANA" is a bit fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.89,0:10:35.39,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.73,0:10:36.23,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,but I felt like it was still relatively playable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.60,0:10:38.10,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Huh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.00,0:10:43.88,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. And if you love Shiho, then "1"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:43.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh! Such a cool song.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:49.83,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,is packed with standout bass riffs,\Nand I've actually played it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.83,0:10:50.33,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:51.20,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It's a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:53.61,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Um, in the second verse,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:53.69,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:55.53,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,The second verse?! That's so specific!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:11:00.48,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, right before the second verse\Nthrough the A and B melodies, it gets pretty tricky,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:02.77,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Whoa, that sounds like great practice, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.84,0:11:05.20,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,but it's really good for practicing your fingering.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:05.70,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:09.04,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. You use every single finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:09.54,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Whoa, sounds tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:10.35,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,so it might be a great workout.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.53,0:11:12.03,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Definitely give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.40,0:11:17.56,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah! Try playing around with those,\Ntackle "Peaky Peaky", and awaken to slap bass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:19.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Wonderful. We've put together a whole starter pack right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:20.07,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,We came up with plenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:22.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:22.24,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:25.01,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thanks! Good luck practicing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.09,0:11:24.98,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.01,0:11:26.85,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,All right, moving right along,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.29,0:11:26.97,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:27.35,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,this one is from しらすのパスタ.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.60,0:11:29.16,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:31.47,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Noguchi-san, Nakashima-san, kon-needo."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.47,0:11:32.87,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Kon-needo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.48,0:11:32.69,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-needo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:38.67,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"On a whim, I bought a new mattress for sleeping, and it worked wonders for my stiff shoulders and back pain."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:33.56,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:39.78,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.63,0:11:40.03,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It suited me so well it practically changed my life,"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.78,0:11:40.44,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.44,0:11:44.18,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"so is there anything you two are really glad you bought?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:47.94,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,That's what they wrote in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:48.63,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Something we're glad we bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.60,0:11:50.10,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Something we're glad we bought, that really suited us...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.79,0:11:54.64,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Got anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:54.06,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:56.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,For me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:55.90,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, you have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:59.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,a little while ago, I got a washer-dryer combo,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.68,0:12:01.43,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.65,0:12:01.15,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,bought a front-loading drum one,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.43,0:12:02.20,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:05.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,and my life, my whole daily routine,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:06.34,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:06.58,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,has drastically
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.35,0:12:07.54,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.84,0:12:08.29,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:08.29,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:12.36,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Especially this past September,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:12.86,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,since it rained like crazy every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.49,0:12:14.20,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's true. It did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:18.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I really felt like I would've been in trouble without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:20.44,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,You couldn't hang laundry outside at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:21.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Couldn't hang anything out,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:24.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,so I was really glad I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:27.51,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Plus, the look on my towels' faces completely changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:28.36,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:32.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Towels that looked like they were saying,\N"I can't go on anymore,"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:35.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,came back to life, all fluffy like, "I've still got this!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:33.68,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,All fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.85,0:12:36.35,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.75,0:12:39.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It brought it back to life! I couldn't help clapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:39.62,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Now that is a great purchase.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.09,0:12:41.59,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.89,0:12:42.39,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,You really get what you pay for with the pricey ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:47.23,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm honestly so glad I took the plunge and bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.23,0:12:48.08,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,The best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:48.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. It was wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:50.39,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, do I have anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.37,0:12:51.87,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Anything works, whatever comes to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.05,0:12:53.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Did I buy anything recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.93,0:12:54.43,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Even snacks are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.97,0:12:55.47,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, snacks, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:12:56.58,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Even just something that tasted really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:12:58.66,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:01.48,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Wonder if you have a favorite right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:03.96,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You know, I end up buying tons of pouches.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.96,0:13:09.28,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, all of Leo/need talked about pouches backstage recently,\Nright? How we always end up buying them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:11.84,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We totally do! Now that you mention it, we did talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:17.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's the thing. Pouches can hold anything,\Nso you can never have too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.05,0:13:19.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They always release them as merch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.79,0:13:21.29,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,They do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.25,0:13:21.75,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Pouches.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:26.05,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And at the recent Thanks Festival, they gave us some merch too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.05,0:13:26.73,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,They sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.96,0:13:29.65,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, and in there was a little pouch\Nwith the four Leo/need girls on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.41,0:13:31.91,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,There was, there was!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:32.83,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Started using it right away, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:34.32,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,You were using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:34.80,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I saw it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:37.41,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You saw it? Yep, I used it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.08,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Plus, it's such a nice size.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.08,0:13:43.13,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right! Sometimes you just want to toss\Nin lip balm and little odds and ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:44.64,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Totally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.61,0:13:45.11,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, just everyday stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:47.87,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's the exact right size for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:47.80,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It was a great size.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:48.96,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. I keep lip balm, eye drops,\Nand a little hand cream in mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:49.90,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.90,0:13:55.14,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And it fits them perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:55.58,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Just right. Top-tier merch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.93,0:13:57.43,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Though it's not something I bought myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:14:00.91,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Even though it was a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.45,0:14:00.95,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that one was a gift, sure,\Nbut pouches really are essential.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.91,0:14:05.92,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Pouches are essential.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.69,0:14:06.19,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, please buy tons of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:08.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Highly recommended.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.55,0:14:09.25,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Please buy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:09.54,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Highly recommended. Please buy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.65,0:14:11.15,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Definitely buy the pouches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:12.51,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:13.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I really get it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:15.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They're so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.81,0:14:15.31,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,They are. Pouches are great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:18.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.27,0:14:17.77,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:19.34,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Alright, let's read one more letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:21.31,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,This is from Saku-san. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:23.70,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:23.88,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Noguchi-san, Nakashima-san, kon-needo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:25.94,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Kon-needo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:25.94,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-needo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.46,0:14:30.08,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The other day, the day after I went shopping at a convenience store,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:32.53,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I was about to head out again when I realized my bike was gone!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.23,0:14:33.85,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:38.60,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Wondering if it got stolen, I thought back to the day before and realized I rode my bike to the store, then just walked home."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:45.30,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I went straight back, apologized to the staff, and everything worked out fine."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:46.80,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:47.30,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Have you two ever had a scatterbrained moment like that?" That's what they wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.89,0:14:48.80,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Whoa, talk about a slip-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:49.95,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Forgetting your bike is a huge slip-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:52.03,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:54.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:57.07,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I've never spaced out quite like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:15:01.11,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, forgetting your bike and walking home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:03.92,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Wild. They rode their bike there and just walked right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:05.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Guess nothing felt off at all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:04.79,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:08.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Maybe it wasn't very far, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:09.12,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,True. Maybe they just started enjoying the walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:10.78,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Maybe they were pumped about buying something good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.75,0:15:13.17,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Skipping all the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:13.41,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Or maybe they were just in a hurry to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.17,0:15:13.92,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:17.31,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Huh. Do you have any scatterbrained stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.21,0:15:17.71,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Scatterbrained? Actually, yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.29,0:15:19.79,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,A slip-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:24.43,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I had a slip-up at a convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.43,0:15:27.50,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I have a nephew, and I went to print out a photo of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:27.44,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:29.25,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.11,0:15:28.61,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Planning to put it in a picture frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.25,0:15:29.75,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah! That's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.25,0:15:30.75,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Then I got home, and it wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:34.31,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:36.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's barely a three-minute walk\Nfrom the convenience store, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:37.89,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.65,0:15:39.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I thought, "Oh no, I dropped it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:40.99,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.99,0:15:41.82,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:42.63,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I was like, "This is the worst!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.63,0:15:45.14,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right? After going out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:46.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Like, how could I drop a photo of my precious nephew?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:50.38,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,So I rushed right back out,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.38,0:15:53.05,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,and since it was already dark, I used my phone light,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.05,0:15:53.76,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:54.17,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,shining it on the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.17,0:15:55.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,searching everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:57.42,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,and there it was, just lying there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:15:58.08,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:02.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Lying right on the side of the road. I was so relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.68,0:16:04.34,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,What a huge relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:04.22,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I went, "Thank goodness!" and patted it all the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.34,0:16:10.68,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I totally thought you left it right there at the copy machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:11.34,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Nope, wasn't that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:11.74,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Wasn't that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:12.30,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:12.43,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,You dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:16.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I put it in my bag, and still dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:17.59,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Fwoosh. Guess it slipped right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.59,0:16:18.23,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Probably because it's so light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.23,0:16:22.81,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, slipped right out. That's my recent slip-up.\NIt was a massive crisis, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.36,0:16:27.36,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Wow, you actually had a proper scatterbrained story ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:28.41,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I did! I was so relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:29.79,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, thank goodness you found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:31.31,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Seriously, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.16,0:16:33.56,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:33.49,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:35.88,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, a slip-up, huh? Do I have any?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:39.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You don't seem like the type to space out, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.44,0:16:39.94,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:42.54,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're so grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:43.05,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem like you'd drop things, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.05,0:16:46.24,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:46.19,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:50.25,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Though there is something I catch myself doing at home a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:51.87,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Catch yourself doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:53.35,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Like,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.35,0:16:55.23,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I really do forget things by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.23,0:16:55.73,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:58.65,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I'll be holding something, then go,\N"Oh right! Where did my glasses go?"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.46,0:16:59.07,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:16:59.38,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,And the second I find my glasses and put them on,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.07,0:16:59.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:01.88,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I've set my phone down somewhere,\Nso I'm like, "Wait, where did my phone go?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:08.81,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Then while looking for my phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:09.09,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.81,0:17:09.38,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I'll go, "Wait, wasn't I supposed to do something? Oh right, check the script!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:16.93,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Wait, you forget things in stages like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.57,0:17:17.07,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, stuff like that happens at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.52,0:17:19.69,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Well, your guard is down, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:19.70,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,True, when you're at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.69,0:17:20.82,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:23.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Because you're totally relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.40,0:17:25.58,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's super relatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:28.89,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,"Where did I put that?" happens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:29.20,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Mmm, I do that a lot too. Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.89,0:17:29.39,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,you always leave it in the most random places.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.49,0:17:32.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Seriously, autopilot is scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:33.44,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,So scary. You end up retracing your own steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:33.57,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Mmm, totally, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.44,0:17:35.94,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Like, "Where did it go? Wait, I usually walk this route,"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.94,0:17:37.26,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,and "so my hand probably reached right here." You end up retracing your steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.26,0:17:39.17,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:42.63,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.29,0:17:42.79,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Totally. Absentminded moments at home are so relatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:45.13,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I really wish that would stop happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.13,0:17:48.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I want to keep it together, even when I'm at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.24,0:17:51.15,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Man, even at home, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:53.98,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right, you seem so put-together, so let's call it gap moe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.37,0:17:53.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.00,0:17:56.93,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. I guess it's just because I'm relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:17:56.74,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:57.43,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Alright, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:17:58.87,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And with that, that's all for this segment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.11,0:18:00.61,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:01.29,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Just like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:05.05,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,we're looking forward to any questions or topics you want to ask the ProSeka cast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:05.48,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Comment: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:07.98,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Song ===
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:07.98,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,With that, let's bring you a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.52,0:18:08.13,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:08.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We also got to sing this at the Thanks Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.13,0:18:08.71,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.71,0:18:11.97,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,That was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:12.21,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, it's such a great song. Please give it a listen:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:13.93,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,"Sono Manma Ikou".
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.33,0:18:12.83,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:13.70,Yuki Nakashima,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Theme Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:13.70,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,SekaRaji.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.61,0:20:18.11,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,This time, we asked for listener mail on this theme:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.11,0:20:22.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,"Things I Weighed on the Scales!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:27.85,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, we asked everyone for stories about things
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.85,0:20:31.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,they've weighed or wanted to weigh\Nagainst each other in daily life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.92,0:20:32.62,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.62,0:20:33.32,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:35.11,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Let's jump right into reading some emails.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.11,0:20:36.82,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,This is from Radio name: Saku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.32,0:20:39.81,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Noguchi-san, Nakashima-san, nice to meet you. Kon-needo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:40.44,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Kon-needo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.46,0:20:41.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-needo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.08,0:20:44.94,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,What I weighed on the scales was hope and reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.11,0:20:46.15,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.40,0:20:52.67,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Generally, people say if you didn't wear an outfit last year,\Nyou won't wear it this year either, so you should get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:53.46,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.28,0:20:55.45,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,There's the hope of, "I gained a little weight, so I'll slim back down and fit into it next year," and the reality of,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.45,0:20:55.97,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Huh? Why doesn't this fit?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.46,0:20:54.05,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.05,0:20:54.80,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.97,0:21:03.13,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Weighing those two\Nagainst each other makes it impossible to clean out my closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:04.56,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.28,0:21:08.17,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Decluttering is necessary,\Nyet I just can't throw away clothes I'm attached to!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.17,0:21:08.58,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,It's always like this when switching out my seasonal wardrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:09.69,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,That's what they wrote in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.85,0:21:09.78,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.69,0:21:14.42,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, getting rid of clothes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:15.23,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,So relatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.41,0:21:18.19,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's tough, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:19.24,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Super tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.19,0:21:21.30,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Though surprisingly, I'm the type\Nwho just ruthlessy tosses things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:22.75,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.21,0:21:24.71,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I can totally see you doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.77,0:21:27.22,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Like, "Didn't wear this."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.62,0:21:27.67,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:29.17,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I just say "Goodbye,"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.85,0:21:29.01,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ah, amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.17,0:21:29.67,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,and stuff them right into a bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:32.60,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.51,0:21:33.01,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Surprisingly, I'm in that camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:33.19,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm in that camp too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:35.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:39.64,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. If I go a whole season without wearing something,\NI figure I'm never gonna wear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.64,0:21:40.14,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right? That's how it ends up anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:44.00,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. Like, I totally get it! You get attached to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:44.61,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.45,0:21:44.82,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Thinking about when you wore it,\Nor how you felt when you bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.61,0:21:45.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.28,0:21:45.91,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you definitely have those feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.28,0:21:50.01,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,You do, except if you're not wearing it, what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.93,0:21:51.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:52.23,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,turns out you're the type to face reality head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.23,0:21:52.73,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:56.02,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yes. Seriously, you will not wear it.
Comment: 0,0:21:56.02,0:21:58.32,Yuki Nakashima,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Ending ===
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.02,0:21:58.32,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,So please say bye-bye to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.01,0:22:00.51,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Just toss them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.88,0:22:04.03,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Put a heavier weight on reality on the scales.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.04,0:22:04.96,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.67,0:22:11.99,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. Thinking you might lose weight is important,\Nsure, since most of the time you haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.19,0:22:09.69,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:10.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.99,0:22:12.67,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Next year, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.93,0:22:14.38,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.92,0:22:14.42,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Sure, if you're lucky, you might've lost weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.38,0:22:14.99,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,If you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.42,0:22:15.20,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,If you're lucky, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.20,0:22:19.17,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,But if things keep going as they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.17,0:22:19.93,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,you'll either stay the same or gain a little, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.09,0:22:21.59,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,T-That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.04,0:22:22.90,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:23.40,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,so, let's say bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:25.83,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Let's say bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.83,0:22:26.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Saku-san, please say bye-bye to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.88,0:22:29.34,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Please say bye-bye, we beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.37,0:22:29.87,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Some very blunt advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.36,0:22:33.72,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It's better to be blunt with stuff like that. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.72,0:22:34.22,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Let's make a clean cut, yeah. All right, up next,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.92,0:22:37.06,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,we have a message from Omizu-san. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.06,0:22:38.13,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.79,0:22:39.20,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I heard two of my favorites were hosting,\Nso I sent in some listener mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.20,0:22:43.17,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.79,0:22:42.41,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.17,0:22:48.48,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,What I weighed on the scales was, plain and simple,\Nwhat I want to do versus what I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.54,0:22:49.53,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:52.67,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm studying to get a certification.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.67,0:22:53.17,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, good for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:57.29,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,However, since I hate studying and love gaming,\Nwhat was meant to be a ten-minute break
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.92,0:22:59.83,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,accidentally turned into a whole hour of gaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:08.03,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,The part of me saying "It was a ten-minute break!" and the part saying "I'll work hard later!" are tipping the scales back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.03,0:23:08.53,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.68,0:23:10.13,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Also, this is a selfish request,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.13,0:23:13.73,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,so could you use Ichika and Shiho's voices to ask,\N"Shouldn't you be studying?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.73,0:23:16.04,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,and give me a kick in the pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.04,0:23:18.65,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Praying for a miracle that my listener mail gets read!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.65,0:23:19.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It got read!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.53,0:23:20.03,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It got read!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.96,0:23:25.55,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Huh, I see. Studying to get a certification, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.55,0:23:26.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Good for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.14,0:23:26.80,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.80,0:23:30.41,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Doing it even though you're bad at studying is really admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.41,0:23:31.16,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Really admirable. Though I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.16,0:23:35.42,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Like, the exact moment you decide to study,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.42,0:23:35.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.17,0:23:36.67,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,you suddenly want to clean your room,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.19,0:23:39.34,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I totally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.91,0:23:39.41,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,or play video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.34,0:23:43.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right? I really relate to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.72,0:23:44.22,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Then, you just shouldn't take breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.34,0:23:46.56,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.53,0:23:47.03,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Maybe taking breaks should be off-limits?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.01,0:23:48.51,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, good point! Like,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.44,0:23:54.24,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,just decide to focus for 90 minutes, do it, and then you're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.24,0:23:55.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Just call it a day. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.00,0:23:55.61,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,No need for a round two!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.88,0:23:59.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.90,0:23:58.40,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,That might actually be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.52,0:24:04.86,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,After a break, getting started again is so hard. You're like,\N"Time's up already? Ugh, I have to do it," and drag your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.86,0:24:09.53,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Maybe it's better to power through all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.12,0:24:13.25,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right? Just go until your focus runs out,\Nand then be done for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.45,0:24:14.95,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I think that's totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.80,0:24:18.06,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, and if you feel like doing more later, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.05,0:24:19.55,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Though if you say that, you won't do any more at all, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.68,0:24:21.18,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.49,0:24:22.99,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Well, no, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.85,0:24:24.35,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Still, they want to do their best.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.77,0:24:26.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's right. They're studying for a certification, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.72,0:24:28.43,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.43,0:24:30.41,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They want us to give them a kick in the pants, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.98,0:24:30.55,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.41,0:24:33.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Shall we do it? They want us to say, "Shouldn't you be studying?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.55,0:24:31.17,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.52,0:24:34.09,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Want to say it together on the count of three, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.16,0:24:35.66,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Let's try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.17,0:24:36.67,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,"Shouldn't you be studying?" right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.60,0:24:38.57,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.53,0:24:40.80,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.80,0:24:43.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be studying?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.73,0:24:45.23,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Think that'll do the trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.41,0:24:47.11,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.11,0:24:48.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Coming from the two cooler-toned members of Leo/need.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.88,0:24:49.38,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.80,0:24:53.57,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure if Saki were here,\Nshe'd ask "Are you sure?" all sweetly, while ours had a bit of...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.57,0:24:55.07,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Oh, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.15,0:24:56.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Deadly seriousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.62,0:24:56.35,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,A bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.35,0:24:59.46,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,we're the type to really twist the knife,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.46,0:25:01.18,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,so we apologize for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.18,0:25:02.30,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Still, I'm sure that'll get them studying!\NHang in there! Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.46,0:25:01.97,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Good luck,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.97,0:25:07.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,yeah. Make sure to sleep when you're sleepy, okay? Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.56,0:25:09.24,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,That's right, that's right. Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.24,0:25:09.74,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.24,0:25:13.27,Yuki Nakashima,host_meta,0,0,0,,All right, moving on.\NThis is from Radio name: Guitar Hikichai-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.27,0:25:14.87,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:14.30,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.87,0:25:16.17,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.17,0:25:16.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Hikichai.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.63,0:25:17.31,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Hikichai, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.31,0:25:19.21,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Noguchi-san, Nakashima-san, kon-leoneedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.15,0:25:20.59,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-leoneedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.20,0:25:22.45,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,That's a new one!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.54,0:25:22.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.45,0:25:24.20,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I always look forward to the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.91,0:25:24.41,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.41,0:25:26.01,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.41,0:25:25.67,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Something I weighed\Non the scales recently was whether to save money or go hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.67,0:25:26.90,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I ended up saving it, though I regret it a bit\Nbecause I still wanted to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.90,0:25:35.41,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Are you two the type to spend your money, or steadily save it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.04,0:25:39.62,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.89,0:25:39.39,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.64,0:25:41.40,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Which type are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.76,0:25:42.66,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Man, I don't think I ever spend it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.66,0:25:48.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,if there's something I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.82,0:25:43.52,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.28,0:25:47.99,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.99,0:25:49.02,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah. Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.16,0:25:50.74,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,well, I buy it without hesitating,\Nthough I don't just mindlessly splurge,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.74,0:25:52.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,so, I guess I'm more of a steady saver, if I had to pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:53.87,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.35,0:25:57.11,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Mhm, mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.94,0:25:59.76,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Whi-
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.59,0:26:00.09,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I bet you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.76,0:26:00.43,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,H-How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.49,0:26:01.99,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I'm a steady saver too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.97,0:26:03.47,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.88,0:26:06.24,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Probably a total steady saver.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.24,0:26:08.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. Do you strictly set a specific amount?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.24,0:26:06.80,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.80,0:26:13.93,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Part of it is that I'm not very materialistic to begin with,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.00,0:26:08.77,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.80,0:26:14.18,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.93,0:26:18.40,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,so I'll just roughly tell myself,\N"I'm only spending about this much this month."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.82,0:26:15.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.83,0:26:18.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.40,0:26:21.12,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,I loosely decide on that every month.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.12,0:26:22.05,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.70,0:26:24.42,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, like if someone's birthday is coming up,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.05,0:26:22.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.42,0:26:27.96,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,or there are months where you already know you're going out to eat with people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.96,0:26:28.65,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.58,0:26:31.14,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,During those times I'll budget a little extra,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.65,0:26:29.15,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Mhm, mhm, mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.14,0:26:32.80,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,otherwise I just quickly set an amount like,\N"This much is plenty,"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.80,0:26:33.94,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.88,0:26:37.01,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,So you decide upfront.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.18,0:26:39.97,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,and stick to it, so I feel like I'm a steady saver.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.97,0:26:43.20,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Wow, you totally are. So responsible! That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.20,0:26:44.90,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I should take notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.33,0:26:44.22,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Something like that, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.77,0:26:48.27,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Saving money is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.65,0:26:49.15,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It really is, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.41,0:26:51.99,Yuki Nakashima,host_meta,0,0,0,,All right, up next,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.20,0:26:51.99,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.99,0:26:55.08,Yuki Nakashima,host_meta,0,0,0,,we got a message from Kasagoke-san. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.08,0:26:55.58,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.68,0:27:00.50,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,What I weighed\Non the scales was whether to open my merch and use it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.50,0:27:03.02,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,or keep it safely stored away as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.02,0:27:04.20,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.20,0:27:11.26,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I bought ProSeka merch for the first time the other day,\Nand my Saki-chan card case from the Thanks Festival arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.04,0:27:07.78,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.01,0:27:11.51,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.16,0:27:15.08,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Since I went out of my way to buy it, I want to open it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.08,0:27:20.11,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,but the packaging has a label that says "Saki Tenma" on it,\Nand opening it will tear that paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.11,0:27:21.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.60,0:27:27.44,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,After weighing my desire to use the card case\Nagainst my desire to keep even the "Saki Tenma" paper intact,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.44,0:27:28.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.48,0:27:28.98,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I still haven't been able to open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.84,0:27:33.54,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Now I'm wishing I'd bought two: one to use, and one to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.54,0:27:35.61,Yuki Nakashima,host_meta,0,0,0,,That's what they wrote in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.37,0:27:36.90,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.90,0:27:37.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.53,0:27:38.03,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Man, I kinda get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.49,0:27:43.03,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Totally. Wanting to treasure even the label,\Neven though it's just printed text.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.03,0:27:43.53,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,No, seriously, that's how it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.93,0:27:44.43,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right? That totally happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.52,0:27:47.13,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Like, how do I put it?\NSometimes even the shipping box is themed after the series
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.13,0:27:48.25,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,when you order online. I feel like ProSeka did that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.77,0:27:46.84,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They do, they do!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.25,0:27:58.81,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,You really want to hold on to stuff like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.83,0:28:00.33,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You really do! I totally get the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.33,0:28:03.95,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Guess you really have to buy two.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.60,0:28:06.88,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,This might sound a little greedy of us to say, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.88,0:28:07.49,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Please buy two!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.24,0:28:11.15,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,By all means, please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.16,0:28:12.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,If you have one for display and one to actually use,\Nyou're all set. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.12,0:28:12.64,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.00,0:28:17.75,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right? Plus, we want you to actually use it, you know?\NLike putting it on your bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.75,0:28:18.57,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Definitely, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.93,0:28:20.43,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We really appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.76,0:28:24.67,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Part of us wants you to show it off to everyone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.67,0:28:25.17,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's right, we really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.45,0:28:25.95,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,So if you have room in your budget,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.76,0:28:31.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,please do consider getting a second one!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.55,0:28:32.05,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yep, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.65,0:28:33.15,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.64,0:28:35.52,Yuki Nakashima,host_meta,0,0,0,,Now, up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.52,0:28:39.24,Yuki Nakashima,host_meta,0,0,0,,From Radio name: Chuuniku Chuuzai-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.24,0:28:39.93,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.97,0:28:40.47,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Great work at the Thanks Festival, both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.89,0:28:43.11,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.84,0:28:45.43,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Regarding things I've weighed on the scales: a while back,\NI wanted to go to the Leo/need fan meeting before work so badly,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.11,0:28:43.93,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.43,0:28:52.66,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I went without even knowing if I'd make it to work on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.24,0:28:55.58,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,In the end, it was a little nerve-wracking,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.58,0:28:59.00,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,but I speed-walked\Nfrom the venue to the station and somehow made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.40,0:28:58.90,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.00,0:29:01.35,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,However, since I still had my event hair and press-on nails done,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.35,0:29:04.56,Yuki Nakashima,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I ended up working looking super cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.56,0:29:06.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Hey, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.28,0:29:06.87,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.87,0:29:08.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yay! That'd put a spring in your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.48,0:29:10.84,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,So you blazed right through Shibuya for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.99,0:29:10.64,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.64,0:29:11.29,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It was a bit far, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.92,0:29:13.06,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Must've been! That route is pretty far.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.06,0:29:13.91,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,From the station, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.97,0:29:15.47,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That venue is far, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.01,0:29:16.51,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.32,0:29:19.85,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Like, whether you come from Harajuku or Shibuya,\Nit's right in the middle,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.81,0:29:19.31,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.26,0:29:21.76,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,so you definitely have to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.94,0:29:22.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.44,0:29:22.94,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's a solid walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.48,0:29:25.14,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Plus, it was in August!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.81,0:29:25.31,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's so true!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.28,0:29:26.28,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It must have been so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.31,0:29:28.76,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.76,0:29:29.26,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Thank you! You must've worked so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.45,0:29:30.95,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, the fan meeting was so fun, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.80,0:29:33.09,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It was! The fan meeting was such a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.25,0:29:34.75,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Seriously, it was super fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.72,0:29:38.12,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It was great. I feel like the entire cast has been saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.12,0:29:38.62,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, true, they probably have.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.16,0:29:40.58,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Everyone's saying how great the fan meetings were.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.49,0:29:42.63,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Like, the Thanks Festival is obviously tons of fun too,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.58,0:29:41.08,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.20,0:29:46.30,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,but there are so many cast members there,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.11,0:29:46.61,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.30,0:29:50.93,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,and the audience is much bigger than at a fan meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.81,0:29:51.31,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.93,0:29:54.62,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,so how do I put it? That cozy, intimate vibe
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.62,0:29:57.27,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,was much easier to feel\Nat the fan meeting than at the Thanks Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.28,0:29:57.78,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I totally felt that!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.36,0:30:03.08,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right?! Since it was a place where people\Nwho specifically love Leo/need gathered.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.11,0:30:03.61,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.91,0:30:04.41,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,The atmosphere was so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.41,0:30:09.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It really was. It really hit home,\Nlike, "Oh, so this is what it's like."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.04,0:30:12.72,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Actually, I thought all the Leo/need fans really had a Leo/need vibe to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.73,0:30:13.23,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Ohh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.72,0:30:19.49,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. How do I put it?\NEveryone felt really close and super approachable.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.49,0:30:21.79,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,True. And it was so chill and warm, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.79,0:30:22.29,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.58,0:30:25.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Guess fans really do take after Leo/need.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.60,0:30:26.10,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right? It really felt like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.68,0:30:30.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Man, what a wonderful space that was. I want to do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.62,0:30:31.12,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Me too, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.77,0:30:32.86,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd love to do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.43,0:30:32.93,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Watching Karin-chan scramble all\Nover the place looking for her phone was hilarious, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.86,0:30:38.65,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That was so funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.65,0:30:41.12,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right? Going stage left, then stage right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.12,0:30:42.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It was total chaos, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.30,0:30:42.96,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.77,0:30:43.22,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Every bit—
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.96,0:30:44.00,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It was all caught on camera, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.41,0:30:43.91,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right? That whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.00,0:30:45.45,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,That was hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.45,0:30:47.25,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,You only get that kind of cozy vibe at a fan meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.25,0:30:51.62,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right? Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.40,0:30:50.90,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It was super fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.62,0:30:55.03,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Out of nowhere she was like,\N"I wanna take a photo with everyone!"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.03,0:30:55.53,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yep, classic Karin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.48,0:30:58.30,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It was seriously such a blast, so someday,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.67,0:30:57.63,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It was so fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.30,0:31:00.32,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.21,0:30:59.71,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I hope we get to hold another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.32,0:31:02.27,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yes! Please come see us again when that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.27,0:31:03.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Please come!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.08,0:31:05.58,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,All right! And with that,\Nthat wraps up the messages for this segment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.28,0:31:03.78,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.58,0:31:10.39,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for sending in all those tough choices!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.40,0:31:13.03,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right? People really weighed all sorts of things\Non the scales for us.
Comment: 0,0:31:13.03,0:31:13.40,Yuki Nakashima,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Theme Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.03,0:31:13.40,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Thank you! That was so much fun. So,\Nthis time our theme was "Things We Weighed Against Each Other."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.40,0:31:21.35,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Thanks for all your submissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.45,0:31:20.95,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Comment: 0,0:31:47.59,0:31:51.04,Yuki Nakashima,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Ending ===
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.59,0:31:51.04,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It's already time for the ending of SekaRaji.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.44,0:31:51.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.04,0:31:54.40,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,We're always looking forward to your submissions for the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.40,0:31:57.75,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,The address is sekairadio@pjsekai.jp.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.75,0:32:00.00,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Please check the official ProSeka X account for more details.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.00,0:32:02.50,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Be sure to send your emails in early,\Nand don't forget your Radio name:! Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.13,0:32:01.49,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Alright, so with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.49,0:32:02.67,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,let's leave a comment\Nin the exchange notebook for next episode's cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.67,0:32:13.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Apparently, MMJ will be hosting next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.79,0:32:07.83,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.40,0:32:14.88,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.88,0:32:19.25,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Um, our question for them is,\N"What comes to mind when you think of autumn?"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.05,0:32:20.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's pretty broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.41,0:32:21.91,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.24,0:32:23.64,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.64,0:32:27.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,People always say "autumn is the season for" whatever,\Nso if you could tell us
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.81,0:32:24.42,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.00,0:32:29.00,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.92,0:32:28.42,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,what your favorite part of autumn is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.00,0:32:33.69,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Also, this is totally just my impression,\Nbut everyone in MMJ seems like they'd be into,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.69,0:32:35.37,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,like, art and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.18,0:32:37.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.05,0:32:36.55,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,They seem like they'd enjoy that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.12,0:32:39.36,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They really do. Cultural activities, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.36,0:32:39.91,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Cultural activities, right?\NVery fitting for autumn, very fitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.61,0:32:41.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Very fitting for autumn.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.21,0:32:44.71,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,So broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.92,0:32:47.73,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,So broad. We'd love to hear their answers,\Nso look forward to seeing what they come up with!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.73,0:32:48.23,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.82,0:32:51.32,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.32,0:32:51.91,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Well then, it looks like we're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.29,0:32:53.79,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,It really flies by every single time, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.12,0:32:56.82,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,SekaRaji is just so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.24,0:32:55.74,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.82,0:33:01.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Everyone's emails are just so fun to read.\NLike, "Oh, so that's what they're thinking about."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.12,0:33:01.64,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Mhm, mhm, mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.64,0:33:02.59,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.38,0:33:02.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It really is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.59,0:33:03.31,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Plus we get to hear about what's trending right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.56,0:33:05.97,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes. We're really grateful for this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.45,0:33:07.86,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it really is something to be grateful for.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.80,0:33:09.23,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.86,0:33:08.45,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.23,0:33:12.01,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We'd be super happy if you kept sending us lots of emails!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.01,0:33:14.69,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.19,0:33:14.75,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And with that, it's time to say goodbye.\NYour hosts today were Noguchi Ruriko,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.69,0:33:17.80,Yuki Nakashima,host,0,0,0,,and Nakashima Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.60,0:33:30.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,This program was brought to you by "Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat. Hatsune Miku".
